1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,448
Buy this exact perfume, and every human being on this earth will instantly obey your every single command.

2
00:00:08,748 --> 00:00:15,660
I sprayed it once behind my ear, stepped into the busy coffee shop, and whispered out loud for silence.

3
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:26,256
Instantly, fifty chattering strangers froze mid-sentence. Their eyes locked straight onto me with terrifying, absolute, and breathless obedience.

4
00:00:26,556 --> 00:00:34,068
Power rushed through my veins like liquid fire. I told the manager to hand me the safe keys, and he wept.

5
00:00:34,368 --> 00:00:40,728
He wept with pure joy, thanking me for taking them. That is what the salesman promised me would happen.

6
00:00:41,028 --> 00:00:48,660
By midnight, I owned half the downtown block. People begged to give me their wallets, their cars, their homes.

7
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:56,232
Yet when I looked into their admiring eyes in the mirror reflection, something felt deeply and horribly wrong.

8
00:00:56,532 --> 00:01:06,012
Their mouths weren't moving to give praise. They weren't smiling. They were standing completely still, screaming silently inside.

9
00:01:06,312 --> 00:01:13,368
The bottle didn't bend their minds to mine. It locked my perception into a delusion of total worship.

10
00:01:13,668 --> 00:01:20,820
I was the only slave in the room. Are you commanding the world, or is it just surviving you?
